<description>&lt;p&gt;Thai border villages in Tak and Mae Sot provinces are experiencing intensified conflict as Myanmar drone strikes and artillery fire spill over, prompting Thai troops to fire warning shots and close border trade for seven days. Security forces have arrested six Cambodians for illegal crossing, two Singaporeans and three Thais for a cross-border prostitution ring, and seized 2.74 million meth pills hidden in furniture. Chinese nationals were rescued before being trafficked to a Myanmar call centre, while Myanmar drone attacks continue and Thai authorities restrict border trade amid Karen State clashes. 35 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Khaosod English&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Gulf News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijAFBVV95cUxQbHFOdVk4T1lDRkY3b000RUxJdEFoN3BSdGUwUEJ1N2VJVnFTZzRHSXFiU0F3akNFQWxYNlhSVjgxSnZxSVh6YUV1eE5IeTktRHpzZk9wbWxocGlXVjljU0NWSnh4RkJNM2M2UGdaSjJmYlpRRHFTSFN0aUpxbDJMUVQ0YmUwdWdzOHZjMQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;9Now&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiYEFVX3lxTE9OV3dZY0pELUV0X2haRE44VTEzVERvODl0YlIzamc1VElfN3lvMkVyZGh2NFJxMEFvdEVOYmdqdEs5UXpqVm9sUmdhTThrZi1LQWh6Vko3ODNkQV9tOGRYRw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Thai PBS World&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijgFBVV95cUxPOUJIeEFxaVAzMW9JR2FFYUtFWUdUSmE3Y1pQVUtwZi01UmJnZkh1N0h5NTZ5ak84ZGlVcjl6MG5Gbl92N1BPRWNSa2RiOUtpZmtZT2tvenFLQm50bVExQUJvVzdLbHc1aFB0WDBXYy0yZnQxUURqZThwY3BLR0lYSC1DTG5NTWNURkItekFn?oc=5&quot;&gt;Thaiger&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Khaosod English&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiygFBVV95cUxOZFFCRG9ZY29LRk5qUFNqZE5MUDZqUno0aTNNMjk1MS0wcVFpbDRjcVBPb1c5UWFYYnFrMzBzZDA0OENrS1N